      "text": [
        "2290 - وَ رُوِيَ : أَنَّ رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ غَدَا مِنْ مِنًى فِي طَرِيقِ ضَبٍّ وَ رَجَعَ مِنْ بَيْنِ اَلْمَأْزِمَيْنِ وَ كَانَ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ إِذَا سَلَكَ طَرِيقاً لَمْ يَرْجِعْ فِيهِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2290 - It has been narrated:\nThe Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) departed from Mina through the road of Dabb and returned through the path between the two mountain passes. The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) would not return on the same path he had taken."
        ]
      }
